---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Thrown Design & Wine | THROWN" description="A thoughtfully curated wine & gift boutique in the heart of the Wheeler District in OKC.">

  <!-- HERO: background video, oversized headline matching site vibe -->
  <section class="relative min-h-[88vh] md:min-h-screen w-full overflow-hidden bg-black flex items-end">
    <video
      class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover"
      src="/videos/shop-hero.mp4"
      autoplay
      muted
      loop
      playsinline
      preload="auto"
      poster="/images/shop/trio-storefront.jpg"
    ></video>

    <!-- Subtle bottom-weighted tint for legibility -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-black/20 to-black/30"></div>

    <!-- Editorial side rails -->
    <div class="hidden md:flex absolute left-6 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-10 items-center gap-3 text-white/80 [writing-mode:vertical-rl] rotate-180 text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.45em] uppercase">
      <span>Wheeler District</span>
      <span class="w-12 h-px bg-white/60"></span>
      <span>OKC</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hidden md:flex absolute right-6 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-10 items-center gap-3 text-white/80 [writing-mode:vertical-rl] text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.45em] uppercase">
      <span>1712 Spoke St</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Headline content (bottom-anchored like homepage) -->
    <div class="relative z-10 w-full px-6 pt-24 pb-16 md:pt-40 md:pb-20">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-white/90">Visit the Shop</div>

        <h1 class="mt-4 font-black leading-[0.82] tracking-tight text-white drop-shadow-[0_4px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]">
          <span class="block text-[18vw] md:text-[14vw]">THROWN</span>
          <span class="block text-[8vw] md:text-[6vw] mt-1">DESIGN <span style="color:#e8a93a;">&amp;</span> WINE</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-8 uppercase text-white font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] text-[clamp(0.7rem,1.6vw,1.25rem)] max-w-3xl">
          A thoughtfully curated wine + gift boutique in the heart of the Wheller Distrct, OKC.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Thrown+Design+and+Wine/@35.448369,-97.5342719,17z"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="px-6 py-3 bg-[color:var(--color-cherry)] text-white text-xs tracking-widest uppercase hover:bg-[color:var(--color-cherry-soft)] transition-colors"
          >
            Visit Us &nbsp;&rarr;
          </a>
          <a
            href="mailto:shop@mythrown.com"
            class="px-6 py-3 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm text-white text-xs tracking-widest uppercase border border-white/40 hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-colors"
          >
            shop@mythrown.com
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TRIO: images + paragraphs -->
  <section class="px-6 pt-20 pb-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-10 md:gap-12">
      <div>
        <img
          src="/images/shop/trio-storefront.jpg"
          alt="Exterior of the THROWN storefront with striped awning"
          class="w-full h-auto block aspect-square object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-relaxed">
          When you&rsquo;re picking out a gift for someone you love, you want something both stylish
          and unique. You and your giftee are individuals, and you both deserve home decor and
          lifestyle accessories that match your unique personalities. That&rsquo;s why Thrown offers
          special, limited-run items you won&rsquo;t find anywhere else.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <img
          src="/images/shop/trio-office.png"
          alt="Amber inside the THROWN office with mosaic LOVE letters"
          class="w-full h-auto block aspect-square object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-relaxed">
          Because our items are limited run, we don&rsquo;t keep an updated inventory on our website.
          You&rsquo;ll have to come and visit us to see what&rsquo;s in stock. However, we can promise
          we&rsquo;ve put lots of thought and care into our selection. Take a trip out to OKC&rsquo;s
          Wheeler District today to see what special items we have in stock.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <img
          src="/images/shop/trio-wine.png"
          alt="Wine bottles with cowboy hat labels and brass horse bottle opener"
          class="w-full h-auto block aspect-square object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-relaxed">
          Our wine selection stems from Amber&rsquo;s passion for both wine itself and the service
          industry, where she worked for thirteen years. She loved learning about wine along the
          way, so wine felt like a natural addition to the boutique space. We&rsquo;ve thoughtfully
          curated our favorite wines by the bottle, and we&rsquo;d love to help you find the perfect
          pour.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto mt-14 text-center">
      <a
        href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Thrown+Design+and+Wine,+1712+Spoke+St,+Oklahoma+City,+OK+73108"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="inline-block bg-black text-white px-8 py-3 text-sm tracking-[0.25em] uppercase hover:bg-[color:var(--color-cherry)] transition"
      >Visit us! 1712 Spoke Street</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ADDRESS / HOURS / CONTACT -->
  <section class="px-6 pb-24 border-t border-black/10 pt-16">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-10">
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-[color:var(--color-cherry)]">Address</div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          1712 Spoke Street<br />
          Wheeler District<br />
          Oklahoma City, OK<br />
          <a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Thrown+Design+and+Wine+Oklahoma+City" class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-[color:var(--color-cherry)]">Get directions</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-[color:var(--color-cherry)]">Hours</div>
        <ul class="mt-3 text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-1">
          <li>Wed &ndash; Sat &middot; 12 &ndash; 5</li>
          <li>Sun &ndash; Tue &middot; Closed</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-[color:var(--color-cherry)]">Contact</div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          <a href="mailto:shop@mythrown.com" class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-[color:var(--color-cherry)]">shop@mythrown.com</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STEP INTO MY OFFICE: embedded video + copy -->
  <section class="px-6 py-24 border-t border-black/10">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-[color:var(--color-cherry)]">Step into my office</div>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight">A space to meet, sip, and shop.</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Thrown is my design office &amp; a space to meet with clients. It also boasts a
          collection of worldly wines, and unique gifts curated by me, Amber. You don&rsquo;t have
          to have a design appointment to stop by. We are open Wednesday &ndash; Saturday 12 &ndash; 5pm.
          Come say hi!
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full aspect-video bg-black overflow-hidden">
        <video
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          src="/videos/shop-office.mp4"
          controls
          muted
          loop
          playsinline
          preload="metadata"
          poster="/images/shop/trio-office.png"
        ></video>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
